oss://${bucket}/${path}
</details>
<details>
<summary>NAS</summary>
nas://${fileSystemId}/${path}
</details>', example='oss://*****-test/dataset/1653421.jpg
nas://0e25d***dff/dataset/1653421.jpg'),
}

