region=<region_id>,workspaceId=<workspace_id>,kind=<kind>,id=<id>
```
region is the Alibaba Cloud region ID. workspaceId is the workspace ID. kind specifies the type. Valid values: PipelineRun (PAI workflow) and ServiceJob (training service). id is the unique identifier.', example='region=cn-shanghai,workspaceId=13**,kind=PipelineRun,id=run-sakdb****jdf'),
